{"page":400,"verses":[{"verse_key":"29:31","surah":29,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا جَآءَتْ رُسُلُنَآ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ بِٱلْبُشْرَىٰ قَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّا مُهْلِكُوٓا۟ أَهْلِ هَـٰذِهِ ٱلْقَرْيَةِ ۖ إِنَّ أَهْلَهَا كَانُوا۟ ظَـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When Our mes-sengers brought the good news [of the birth of a son] to Abraham,they told him, ‘We are about to destroy the people of that town. They are wrongdoers.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"walammā","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَتْ","en_gloss":"came","transliteration":"jāat","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رُسُلُنَآ","en_gloss":"Our messengers","transliteration":"rusulunā","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","en_gloss":"(to) Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱلْبُشْرَىٰ","en_gloss":"with the glad tidings","transliteration":"bil-bush'rā","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, we","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُهْلِكُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"(are) going to destroy","transliteration":"muh'likū","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَهْلِ","en_gloss":"(the) people","transliteration":"ahli","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هَـٰذِهِ","en_gloss":"(of) this","transliteration":"hādhihi","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْقَرْيَةِ ۖ","en_gloss":"town","transliteration":"l-qaryati","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَهْلَهَا","en_gloss":"its people","transliteration":"ahlahā","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"are","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ظَـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"wrongdoers","transliteration":"ẓālimīna","verse_key":"29:31"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:31"}]},{"verse_key":"29:32","surah":29,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ إِنَّ فِيهَا لُوطًا ۚ قَالُوا۟ نَحْنُ أَعْلَمُ بِمَن فِيهَا ۖ لَنُنَجِّيَنَّهُۥ وَأَهْلَهُۥٓ إِلَّا ٱمْرَأَتَهُۥ كَانَتْ مِنَ ٱلْغَـٰبِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Abraham said, ‘But Lot lives there.’ They answered, ‘We know who lives there better than you do. We shall save him and his household, except for his wife: she will be one of those who stay behind.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لُوطًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) Lut","transliteration":"lūṭan","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَحْنُ","en_gloss":"We","transliteration":"naḥnu","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"know better","transliteration":"aʿlamu","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِمَن","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"biman","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِيهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَنُنَجِّيَنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"We will surely save him","transliteration":"lanunajjiyannahu","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَأَهْلَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"and his family","transliteration":"wa-ahlahu","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱمْرَأَتَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his wife","transliteration":"im'ra-atahu","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَانَتْ","en_gloss":"She","transliteration":"kānat","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"(is) of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْغَـٰبِرِينَ","en_gloss":"those who remain behind","transliteration":"l-ghābirīna","verse_key":"29:32"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:32"}]},{"verse_key":"29:33","surah":29,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَمَّآ أَن جَآءَتْ رُسُلُنَا لُوطًا سِىٓءَ بِهِمْ وَضَاقَ بِهِمْ ذَرْعًا وَقَالُوا۟ لَا تَخَفْ وَلَا تَحْزَنْ ۖ إِنَّا مُنَجُّوكَ وَأَهْلَكَ إِلَّا ٱمْرَأَتَكَ كَانَتْ مِنَ ٱلْغَـٰبِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When Our messengers came to Lot, he was troubled and distressed on their account. They said, ‘Have no fear or grief: we shall certainly save you and your household, except for your wife- she will be one of those who stay behind-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَمَّآ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"walammā","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَآءَتْ","en_gloss":"came","transliteration":"jāat","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رُسُلُنَا","en_gloss":"Our messengers","transliteration":"rusulunā","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لُوطًۭا","en_gloss":"(to) Lut","transliteration":"lūṭan","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سِىٓءَ","en_gloss":"he was distressed","transliteration":"sīa","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهِمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"bihim","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَضَاقَ","en_gloss":"and felt straitened","transliteration":"waḍāqa","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِهِمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"bihim","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ذَرْعًۭا","en_gloss":"(and) uneasy","transliteration":"dharʿan","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَقَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they said","transliteration":"waqālū","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَخَفْ","en_gloss":"fear","transliteration":"takhaf","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"29:33"},{"pos":15,"ar":"تَحْزَنْ ۖ","en_gloss":"grieve","transliteration":"t