9,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"(the) sky","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"29:34"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"29:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they have been","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"29:34"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَفْسُقُونَ","en_gloss":"defiantly disobedient","transliteration":"yafsuqūna","verse_key":"29:34"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:34"}]},{"verse_key":"29:35","surah":29,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَد تَّرَكْنَا مِنْهَآ ءَايَةًۢ بَيِّنَةً لِّقَوْمٍ يَعْقِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We left some [of the town] there as a clear sign for those who use their reason.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَد","en_gloss":"And verily","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"29:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَّرَكْنَا","en_gloss":"We have left","transliteration":"taraknā","verse_key":"29:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنْهَآ","en_gloss":"about it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"29:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَايَةًۢ","en_gloss":"a sign","transliteration":"āyatan","verse_key":"29:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَيِّنَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(as) evidence","transliteration":"bayyinatan","verse_key":"29:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a people","transliteration":"liqawmin","verse_key":"29:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَعْقِلُونَ","en_gloss":"who use reason","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","verse_key":"29:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٣٥","en_gloss":"(35)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:35"}]},{"verse_key":"29:36","surah":29,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِلَىٰ مَدْيَنَ أَخَاهُمْ شُعَيْبًا فَقَالَ يَـٰقَوْمِ ٱعْبُدُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَٱرْجُوا۟ ٱلْيَوْمَ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَ وَلَا تَعْثَوْا۟ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ مُفْسِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"To the people of Midian We sent their brother Shuayb. He said, ‘My people, serve God and think ahead to the Last Day. Do not commit evil and spread corruption in the land.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"And to","transliteration":"wa-ilā","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَدْيَنَ","en_gloss":"Madyan","transliteration":"madyana","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَخَاهُمْ","en_gloss":"their brother","transliteration":"akhāhum","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"شُعَيْبًۭا","en_gloss":"Shuaib","transliteration":"shuʿayban","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَقَالَ","en_gloss":"And he said","transliteration":"faqāla","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"O my people","transliteration":"yāqawmi","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱعْبُدُوا۟","en_gloss":"Worship","transliteration":"uʿ'budū","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱرْجُوا۟","en_gloss":"and expect","transliteration":"wa-ir'jū","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"the Day","transliteration":"l-yawma","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَ","en_gloss":"the Last","transliteration":"l-ākhira","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَعْثَوْا۟","en_gloss":"commit evil","transliteration":"taʿthaw","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مُفْسِدِينَ","en_gloss":"(as) corrupters","transliteration":"muf'sidīna","verse_key":"29:36"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٣٦","en_gloss":"(36)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:36"}]},{"verse_key":"29:37","surah":29,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَأَخَذَتْهُمُ ٱلرَّجْفَةُ فَأَصْبَحُوا۟ فِى دَارِهِمْ جَـٰثِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They rejected him and so the earthquake overtook them. When morning came, they were lying dead in their homes.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ","en_gloss":"But they denied him","transliteration":"fakadhabūhu","verse_key":"29:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فَأَخَذَتْهُ